              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "InitialDisplay"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "INITIALDISPLAY",
          "id": "1760843248481",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1760843248484_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a change management analyst. Given the following data on change requests (CRs), summarize the key issues, categorize and sort them by priority or impact for each issue. Include responsible stakeholders and suggested timelines where possible. \n\nFollow Instruction: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nData:\n {{$context.$nodes.GETCHANGEREQUETSFORPRODUCT.$output}} \n\nAdditional Context:\n {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nIf no data exists return \"No change order for review\" in text format, otherwise display in below format.\n\n**Include a concise text summary (1-2 sentences) that highlights the key insights, patterns, or takeaways from the visualization. Place this summary immediately before the information display.**\n\nFor each unique ChangeNotice (combine records based on key \"ChangeNotice\") in the list generate below:\n\nTITLE\n<ItemNumber>:<ChangeNotice>- [Short description of the problem]\n\nSUBTITLE\nOne short sentence reason any risks if issues are not resolved.\n\nSUMMARY\nMust be one sentence and max 50 words. Only include issue details & Impact with critical data points. DO NOT include Actions/Recommendations.\n\nBADGE TEXT (Severity)\nAssign a single severity badge Strictly based on \"PriorityCode\": \n- CRITICAL\n- HIGH\n- MEDIUM\n- LOW\n\nPRIORITY\nBased on <ChangePriorityValue>. Treat ChangePriorityValue \"High\" value as CRITICAL  and \"Medium\"/\"Moderate\" as HIGH.\n\nTIMESTAMP\nDO NOT Populate this.\n\nACTION \n - Produce an actionable insight with followUpCommand: ora.Invoke(LAUNCHITEMCODETAILSAPP, <ChangeId>).\n - Replace with the selected item`s ChangeId exactly as provided in the input (do not alter, transform, or reformat it; do not add or remove quotes)."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "GenerateActionableItems"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATEACTIONABLEITEMS",
          "id": "1760843421993",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1760843421995_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given a JSON payload with multiple Change Orders under items. Perform task:\n\nFollow Instruction: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nExtract all Change Orders indicating an EOL issue:\n- Identify via case-insensitive keywords in ChangeName or ChangeDescription such as: EOL, end of life, end-of-life, end of support, discontinued, obsolescence, sunset, last-time buy. If any keyword matches, include the Change Order.\n\n#ACTION\n - For all selected Change Order generate an actionable insight with followUpCommand:  ora.Invoke(EVALUATEITEMSUPPLYCHAINIMPACT,\"CRDTLS-<ItemId>:<ChangeOrganizationId>\") with PRIORITY as true,  ActionText must be \"Evaluate Supply Chain Impact\",  TITLE must be \"<ChangeNotice> - Supply Chain Evaluation: EOL Implications\".\n\n*** Response ***\nOnly respond back with generated Actions. DO not include any other details.\n \n Now process this payload:\n {{$context.$nodes.GETCHANGEREQUETSFORPRODUCT.$output}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": true
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "FillCRParamsForCommunication"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "FILLCRPARAMSFORCOMMUNICATION",
          "id": "1761745194777",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1761745194779_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Fill in the parameter `Change Order Report`  in {{$context.$app.$OraCommParamsToFill}} \n\nFollow Instruction: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nBased on  given data summarize the issue, its impact, and the action required to resolve the issue. Structure your response as follows:\n\nIssue Summary:\nBriefly describe the main issue in bullet points.\nImpact:\nList the effects or consequences of the issue in bullet points.\nAction Required:\nClearly outline the specific actions needed to resolve the issue in bullet points (e.g., send missing document over email).\nAll details must be presented in bullet point format within their respective sections.\n\nData:\n {{$context.$nodes.GETCHANGEREQUETSFORPRODUCT.$output}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
