              "type": "string",
              "value": "Data Context: {{$context.$nodes.GETCHANGEREQUETSFORPRODUCT.$output}} \n\nUser Query : {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nAnswer to user question based on Data Context.\n\nAlways Generate Summary in Bullet points on top of the display outcome.\n- Produce a concise executive summary\n- Actions and recommendations with owners (short action plan)\n- Prepare change-notice text for stakeholders\n\n**Do Not Generate any follow-up Action**"
