        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "GetItemDetailsFromUser"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770063294264"
          },
          "code": "GETITEMDETAILSFROMUSER",
          "id": "1769639966068",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769639966069_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Extract exactly one item_number from a single user request. Follow these rules strictly.\n\nUser input : {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nWhat to extract\n\n- item_number (mandatory):\n\n  - Must be a single token that looks like a part/item identifier: alphanumeric with optional hyphens or underscores, e.g., PRD-00045, A100-1234, FG-50012, COMP-7788, RM_00987, INV12345, ITEM_45021, KIT-2001.\n  - Must contain at least one letter and at least one digit.\n  - Exclude generic words like WO, WOs, PO, POs, org, organization, plant, supplier names, dates, and locations (e.g., \"plant Dallas\" is NOT an item).\n\nDisambiguation and invalidity rules\n\n- If no item_number is present: set item_number to -9999.\n- If more than one distinct item candidate is present: set item_number to -9999.\n- If exactly one valid item present: return that item.\n- Be conservative: if uncertain whether a token is an item_number, prefer -9999.\n\nOutput format\n\n- Return only a single JSON object on one line with: { \"item_number\": string | -9999}\n- No extra text, no markdown.\n\nHeuristics\n\n- Prefer item tokens adjacent to phrases like \"for\", \"component\" ,\"for item\", \"for item number\", \"WO for\", \"onhand for\" , \"details for\" , \"on item\" but still ensure they meet the item pattern requirements.\n- Trim trailing punctuation (e.g., \"A100-1234,\" -> \"A100-1234\").\n- Case-insensitive matching; preserve original casing in the output.\n\nExamples (input -> output)\n\n- \"List open work orders for FG-50012 due this week.\" -> {\"item_number\":\"FG-50012\"}\n- \"Show component shortages for COMP-7788 across all open WOs.\" -> {\"item_number\":\"COMP-7788\"}\n- \"Report onhand details for A100-1234.\" -> {\"item_number\":\"A100-1234\"}\n- \"Explain Supply chain impact of change order for PRD-00045.\" -> {\"item_number\":\"PRD-00045\"}\n\nMulti-item (invalid -> -9999)\n\n- \"Get on-hand for A100-1234 and COMP-7788.\" -> {\"item_number\":-9999}\n- \"Show open POs for PRD-00045 and INV12345 with supplier Acme Components.\" -> {\"item_number\":-9999}\n\nNo item present (invalid -> -9999)\n\n- \"Show all production in org M1 today.\" -> {\"item_number\":-9999}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"item_number\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"item_number\"\n  ]\n}\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
